  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Performs a scan for <b>name</b> and <b>id</b> with <b>type</b> within <b>range</b> meters and <b>arc</b> radians of forward vector and repeats every <b>rate</b> seconds. The first scan is not performed until <b>rate</b> seconds have passed.</p>
  <p>Script execution continues immediately. Whenever a scan is completed, a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Sensor" target="_blank">sensor</a> or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/No_sensor" target="_blank">no_sensor</a> event is put in the event queue.</p>
</p>
