  <p>If <b>name</b>, <b>id</b>, and/or <b>type</b> are empty or 0, they are ignored.</p>
  <p>If <b>id</b> is an invalid key or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/NULL_KEY" target="_blank">NULL_KEY</a> it is treated as empty.</p>
